  "title": "Nutty Apple Crisp",
  "description": "Lovely tart apples are sliced up and arranged in a baking dish with lemon juice, then topped with a delicious crumble made of oats, brown sugar, a bit of flour, butter, and chopped walnuts. Bake the crisp is until the apples are tender and the top lightly browned.",
